# Upload hygiene for the Fuji-only Vercel project (deployed from web/).
# The Monad project deploys from the repo root with the root .vercelignore; this one is
# scoped to web/ because its Root Directory is the upload root.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
tests/
test-results/
playwright*.mts
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
README.md
